{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118628","id":3536381348,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7SyOWk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118628","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118628.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118628.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118628","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118628/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118628/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118628/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/deeb58e52b84b374ddb00f9d511aea6a427cd0a8","number":118628,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Make BlendSpace point labels rearrange to avoid intersection","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Quality-of-life follow up to #110369.\r\n\r\nBlendSpaces have always been unable to represent fully overlapping points, which accidentally happens often when working with wide snapping ranges, and causes confusion. With the addition of name labels, this was at least somewhat alleviated, but these labels overlapping isn't ideal either, and outside of that case, may trouble users with dense layouts too.\r\n\r\nThis PR allows BlendSpace name labels to self-manage Y position to avoid this intersection. Attempted position is above, below, above+offset, below+offset... and so on. Priority in this is determined via index.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc1fb821-3b0d-4a2e-860c-6e2a22cd1710\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/694eec3e-7f06-4ac9-9c62-64e164427e39\r\n\r\nWhile there are other ways to move that could provide better proximity to the point (eg. clockwise for BlendSpace2D), this way ends up being the least complex, most predictable, and more than good enough for all but the most extreme situations, as evidenced above. Feedback for further whittling down complexity would be very appreciated.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> LLM used in first iteration to negotiate BlendSpace2D logic. It has since been fully discarded.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"http